ed their eyesight so that they should struggle for the way. Then how could they have seen?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Hem dileseydik gözlerini üzerinden silme kör ediverirdik de yola dökülürlerdi. Fakat nereden görecekler?", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور اگر ہم چاہتے تو ان کی آنکھیں مٹادیتے پھر لپک کر رستہ کی طرف جاتے تو انہیں کچھ نہ سوجھتا", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan jikalau Kami menghendaki pastilah Kami hapuskan penglihatan mata mereka; lalu mereka berlomba-lomba (mencari) jalan, Maka betapakah mereka dapat melihat(nya).", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَلَوْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نَشَآءُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَطَمَسْنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَلَىٰٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَعْيُنِهِمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَٱسْتَبَقُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/93ef60a3a6bb61646515.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "pa bi pohrlili", "en": "then they would race", "tr": "sonra yarışırlardı", "fr": "alors ils se seraient précipités à la course", "id": "maka mereka akan berlomba", "ur": "پھر وہ دوڑ لگاتے", "bn": "তখন তারা প্রতিযোগিতায় ছুটত", "fa": "آنگاه پیشی می‌گرفتند"}}, {"text": "ٱلصِّرَٰطَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَأَنَّىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُبْصِرُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "فَٱسْتَبِقُوا۟", "count": 2, "first": "2:148", "audio": "audio/7a025dbc479f471b301c.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "so (you all) race!", "bs": "pa se takmičite!", "tr": "böylece yarışın!", "fr": "alors rivalisez !", "id": "maka berlombalah kalian!", "ur": "پس تم سب دوڑو!", "bn": "অতএব 